= Repeal and Replace

The Republican majorities attempt to repeal the Affordable Care Act. In the Senate the margin is a single vote. Town halls fill with angry constituents. Our base is watching.

- @mobilize: Flood town halls and phone lines.
- @negotiate: Offer a narrow compromise.

@mobilize
subtitle: Maximum pressure.
on-arrival: enthusiasm += 5; aca_secured += 1; pop_mod += 0.3; stability += 1

In the end, one senator walks to the well and gives a thumbs-down. The law survives.

@negotiate
subtitle: Awkward, unusual.
on-arrival: mod_dissent -= 3; prog_dissent += 3; enthusiasm -= 1

The offer is rejected by both sides, but it shows we are willing to talk.
